                      %mi I
                      %mo ,
                      %mi A
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi x
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{refl}_{I, A}(x)
            are the same as homogeneous bridge types of
